packages/dsh-kicad test: [31m+[39m
packages/dsh-kicad test: [31m+ ```mermaid[39m
packages/dsh-kicad test: [31m+ flowchart LR[39m
packages/dsh-kicad test: [31m+     A[需求来源：市场 / 用户任务 / 已有产品] --> Q[新建原理图：提问并等待需求确认][39m
